ide, operate, and maintain our Service"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Improve, personalise, and expand our Service"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Communicate with you, including for customer service"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Send you marketing and promotional communications"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Prevent, detect, and investigate potentially illegal activities"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-medium text-[#ffffff] mt-6 mb-3","children":"4. Sharing Your Information"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[#71717A] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information with service providers who perform services on our behalf, such as payment processing (Stripe), email delivery, and data hosting. These service providers are permitted to use your data only as necessary to perform services for us."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-medium text-[#ffffff] mt-6 mb-3","children":"5. Data Storage and Security"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[#71717A] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Your personal information is stored securely in our database. We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction, including encryption of data in transit and at rest, access controls, and regular security reviews."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[#71717A] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"No method of transmission over the internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-medium text-[#ffffff] mt-6 mb-3","children":"6. Data Retention"}],"$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}]}],"$L21"]}],null,"$L22"]}]
